eer soprattutto e i fiamminghi del '400 come Robert Campin e Jan Van Eyck). Fotografia: Sacha Vierny. Da vedere nell'edizione originale: la traduzione fa svaporare i frequenti giochi linguistici."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Identical twin zoologists lose their wives in a car crash caused by a white swan. They become obsessed with the death and decay of animals, and develop a strange and unusual relationship with the driver of the car, a woman who is now an amputee."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ggv1Sp2PdRDUWNClGOMy61DxN6N.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7NVTbSEsUYxAzv0prODP7OCzuPl.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":33078,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ggv1Sp2PdRDUWNClGOMy61DxN6N.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ggv1Sp2PdRDUWNClGOMy61DxN6N.jpg","language":"it","width":541,"height":813},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ggv1Sp2PdRDUWNClGOMy61DxN6N.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ggv1Sp2PdRDUWNClGOMy61DxN6N.jpg","language":"it","width":541,"height":813}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/55eiU0JNfNRqWbpabsf6NukntI2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/55eiU0JNfNRqWbpabsf6NukntI2.jpg","language":"en","width":669,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/55eiU0JNfNRqWbpabsf6NukntI2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/55eiU0JNfNRqWbpabsf6NukntI2.jpg","language":"en","width":669,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bgIzbF6EfmA0j6SwKfWDhxA6MuG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bgIzbF6EfmA0j6SwKfWDhxA6MuG.jpg","language":"e